{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","凛冬战歌"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","한겨울의 군가"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤暴风雪降低对方急速并造成持续伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","눈의 폭풍을 소환해 적군의 급속을 감소시키고 지속 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，寒冬伴随阿尔娜降临战场，降低除阿尔娜外的所有单位40急速和2格射程。\n主动释放时，阿尔娜发出战吼引发暴风雪，暴风雪将清空所有敌人的急速增益且每0.5秒对全场敌人造成40% + 6% ATK伤害，持续8秒。在此期间，暴风雪将暂时屏蔽自身和“凛冬战士”的痛觉，当其受到伤害时，会在后续10秒内逐渐恢复本次失去的50% + 5%生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 시, 겨울이 아르나와 함께 필드에 내려앉아, 아르나를 제외한 필드 내 모든 유닛의 급속을 40, 사정거리를 2 감소시킨다.\n액티브: 아르나가 포효하며 눈의 폭풍을 일으킨다. 눈의 폭풍은 모든 적군의 급속 버프를 제거하고, 8초 동안 0.5초마다 모든 적군에게 40% + 6% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 스킬 지속 시간 동안 눈의 폭풍이 자신과 한겨울의 전사의 고통을 차단하여, 대미지를 받을 시 이후 10초 동안 이번에 잃은 HP의 50% + 5%를 서서히 회복한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":162,"end":167,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":154,"end":159,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":251,"end":256,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":151,"end":163,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至45% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 45% + 6% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至50% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 50% + 6% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至55% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 55% + 6% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 60% + 6% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","同仇敌忾"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","복수의 다짐"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","任命“凛冬战士”并使其获得增益。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","한겨울의 전사를 임명해 버프를 부여한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","布阵时与阿尔娜处于同排的一名友军将晋升为“凛冬战士”，“凛冬战士”免疫“凛冬战歌”带来的急速减益效果，并且永久提高15% + 1.5%生命上限。\n主动释放时，阿尔娜使用长矛穿刺敌人造成340% + 40% ATK伤害，并为自己和“凛冬战士”恢复伤害量100% + 10%的生命。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","배치 시 아르나와 같은 열의 아군 1명을 한겨울의 전사로 진급시킨다. 한겨울의 전사는 한겨울의 군가로 인한 급속 감소 효과에 면역되며, 영구적으로 최대 HP가 15% + 1.5% 증가한다.\n액티브: 아르나가 장창으로 적군을 찔러 340% + 40% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 자신과 한겨울의 전사가 해당 대미지량 100% + 10%의 HP를 회복한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":129,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":92,"end":99,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":132,"end":138,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":179,"end":185,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":92,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":128,"end":142,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 360% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 380% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 400% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","寒霜战舞"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","서리의 춤사위"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","挥动长矛对周围敌人造成伤害，并降低目标急速。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","장창을 휘둘러 주변 적군에게 대미지를 입히고, 목표의 급속을 감소시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","连续挥动长矛，对1格扇形范围内的敌人造成2次120% + 15% ATK伤害，随后横扫周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并降低敌人-50点急速，持续8秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","연속으로 장창을 휘둘러, 부채꼴 범위 1칸 내 적군에게 120% + 15% ATK의 대미지를 2회 입힌다. 이어서 주변 1칸 범위 내의 모든 적군을 휩쓸어 240% + 30% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 8초 동안 적군의 급속을 -50 감소시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":91,"end":97,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/